                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b2915224-a9be-33ab-8902-7b29244263fe",
                        "entry_id": "cba75e7a-3670-3b24-b4bd-1419b1fed16a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To use, or upload music to, the music streaming service SoundCloud."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal",
                            "uncommon"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4044e21a-fc2d-48d0-8d77-6a10a4aae2f8",
                                "sense_id": "b2915224-a9be-33ab-8902-7b29244263fe",
                                "text": "While there aren't any 'big' international names to speak of, it's time to start Soundclouding^([sic]) music by dream pop Parisian producer Dream Koala."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7a735767-0ec8-4f53-98c8-fff9806b1cc5",
                                "sense_id": "b2915224-a9be-33ab-8902-7b29244263fe",
                                "text": "Playing at 3pm on Saturday when the crowds were either shedding their hangovers or at other gigs, their sparsely attended gig at Clwb Ifor Bach would have affected other bands but instead they put on a stunning performance. Two EP's in, the Rhyl garage rockers are deffo an act worth Soundclouding.^([sic])"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d053405-28ce-497c-a854-c8a1e2acb100",
                                "sense_id": "b2915224-a9be-33ab-8902-7b29244263fe",
                                "text": "She's not an extrovert who goes to shows and makes connections with everyone in the room. That's not her strength. But she's a master at the Internet. Through her ninja SoundClouding, she teamed up with DJs from around the globe to remix her songs and post (or repost) to their followers."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "14565b66-cb59-478e-9ad2-5514c34c6bd5",
                                "sense_id": "b2915224-a9be-33ab-8902-7b29244263fe",
                                "text": "It is of course — I admit it — highly implausible that Lady Gaga’s character should be so against taking pictures of celebs on mobile phones; in the real world, an ambitious singer-songwriter like her would be selfie-ing, Instagramming, SoundClouding etc non-stop."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1aa5dc02-41fd-44c2-b59c-d28202e4176d",
                                "sense_id": "b2915224-a9be-33ab-8902-7b29244263fe",
                                "text": "Blogging, microblogging, vlogging, Polyvoring, liking, Pinteresting, Tumbling, Stumbling, hauling, Soundclouding,^([sic]) Tweeting, […] interfacing, interlocutory presence and absence, and the allatonceness this transience all produces and inoculates us to is what metamodernism can best be described as. It is the context of our most current situation and is an adaptation to being 'hyperreal.'"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
